Installation Instructions - Anteater Chess V1.0

1. Extract: tar -xvzf Chess_V1.0_src.tar.gz
2. Enter directory: cd Chess_V1.0_src
3. Build: make
4. Run: ./bin/chess

Requirements: gcc, SDL2, SDL2_ttf
  Install on Ubuntu: sudo apt-get install libsdl2-dev libsdl2-ttf-dev
  Install on Mac: brew install sdl2 sdl2_ttf

For more details, refer to doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf